{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0fACTION.\ud83d\udc36 DOGS. \u2615CAFE.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Revive Mini-the-dog digitally in an atmospheric, neon-drenched cyberpunk world of roguelite action and cafe stories.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Mechanics:</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431790/extras/172157681a9b0005f21a1e21cfa562cc.poster.avif?t=1771724515\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431790/extras/172157681a9b0005f21a1e21cfa562cc.webm?t=1771724515\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431790/extras/172157681a9b0005f21a1e21cfa562cc.mp4?t=1771724515\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25b6\ufe0fExplore biomes and battle monsters spawned from Mini the Dog\u2019s past life experiences!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431790/extras/df116bf479b3bd7bddb75f3abaa9d83b.poster.avif?t=1771724515\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431790/extras/df116bf479b3bd7bddb75f3abaa9d83b.webm?t=1771724515\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431790/extras/df116bf479b3bd7bddb75f3abaa9d83b.mp4?t=1771724515\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>\u25b6\ufe0fBuild your deck to pull off your wildest builds!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431790/extras/22de57e69242e7627091a8bd225de8b4.poster.avif?t=1771724515\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431790/extras/22de57e69242e7627091a8bd225de8b4.webm?t=1771724515\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431790/extras/22de57e69242e7627091a8bd225de8b4.mp4?t=1771724515\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25b6\ufe0fPetting your dog parries attacks and deflects projectiles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431790/extras/6395c810b10661444cf1f35ebd583fea.poster.avif?t=1771724515\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431790/extras/6395c810b10661444cf1f35ebd583fea.webm?t=1771724515\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431790/extras/6395c810b10661444cf1f35ebd583fea.mp4?t=1771724515\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25b6\ufe0fHit streaks activate Turbo and make your weapon super big and you super fast!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431790/extras/0ca0bd0fccce67848bf46356c09a84b4.poster.avif?t=1771724515\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431790/extras/0ca0bd0fccce67848bf46356c09a84b4.webm?t=1771724515\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431790/extras/0ca0bd0fccce67848bf46356c09a84b4.mp4?t=1771724515\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25b6\ufe0fCollect Mini\u2019s memories to uncover a past mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431790/extras/9d1198fc7e20d36b7702462ae7c7941c.poster.avif?t=1771724515\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431790/extras/9d1198fc7e20d36b7702462ae7c7941c.webm?t=1771724515\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431790/extras/9d1198fc7e20d36b7702462ae7c7941c.mp4?t=1771724515\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25b6\ufe0fDiscover the backstories of NPCs you meet in the present reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431790/extras/21a40e9c96c96e578b721a78fff31bfa.poster.avif?t=1771724515\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431790/extras/21a40e9c96c96e578b721a78fff31bfa.webm?t=1771724515\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431790/extras/21a40e9c96c96e578b721a78fff31bfa.mp4?t=1771724515\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25b6\ufe0fRevive Mini and craft her favourite items for her Cyber Paradise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431790/extras/22b79cbc671b42f902ab18212e9a375a.poster.avif?t=1771724515\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431790/extras/22b79cbc671b42f902ab18212e9a375a.webm?t=1771724515\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25b6\ufe0fChoose Cosy Mode for a story-focused playthrough and let the magic wand (and dogs) do the hard work!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Story Overview</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a not-so-distant future, reality's been exposed as a mere computer simulation. Every aspect of life, from our appearance and possessions, to our thoughts and experiences, is pre-determined by algorithms. When we die, we are deleted; our life data fragmented and discarded into The Lost Sector. There's no heaven or hell, just hard, cold digits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yet, amidst the despair of this discovery, you seize the opportunity and turn it into a business - you found Cyber Paradise - a service scavenging the digital remains of the dearly departed in The Lost Sector and reassembling them within a digital sanctuary. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You take on the role of Hayley, a skilled hacker-warrior, and team up with your dog DDmeow on this adventure. Vanquish monsters manifested by the deceased's fear and sorrow; uncover the mystery of your clients' pasts, and bond with the patrons within Mini's cafe that serves as your base. There, amid the hustle and bustle, catch a glimpse of this dystopian world through their shared stories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the first episode, witness a heartfelt narrative through Mini-the-dog's memories as you mend the hearts left behind in the wake of her passing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2431790?t=1771724515","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431790/844870d46fd42378a78fef87e2297ed74a4a6531/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771724515","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431790/0bb530aa79e750878d90e53b1da5fa732720bf1c/capsule_231x87_alt_assets_4.jpg?t=1771724515","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431790/0bb530aa79e750878d90e53b1da5fa732720bf1c/capsule_184x69_alt_assets_4.jpg?t=1771724515","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":2548220,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Press Kit &amp; Fact Sheet</h1><p><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431790/extras/906d4269e3bca2f2e931cd01cf39c961.avif?t=1771724515\" width=614 height=224 /></span></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0fACTION.\ud83d\udc36 DOGS. \u2615CAFE.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Revive Mini-the-dog digitally in an atmospheric, neon-drenched cyberpunk world of roguelite action and cafe stories.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Mechanics:</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431790/extras/172157681a9b0005f21a1e21cfa562cc.poster.avif?t=1771724515\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431790/extras/172157681a9b0005f21a1e21cfa562cc.webm?t=1771724515\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431790/extras/172157681a9b0005f21a1e21cfa562cc.mp4?t=1771724515\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25b6\ufe0fExplore biomes and battle monsters spawned from Mini the Dog\u2019s past life experiences!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431790/extras/df116bf479b3bd7bddb75f3abaa9d83b.poster.avif?t=1771724515\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431790/extras/df116bf479b3bd7bddb75f3abaa9d83b.webm?t=1771724515\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431790/extras/df116bf479b3bd7bddb75f3abaa9d83b.mp4?t=1771724515\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>\u25b6\ufe0fBuild your deck to pull off your wildest builds!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431790/extras/22de57e69242e7627091a8bd225de8b4.poster.avif?t=1771724515\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431790/extras/22de57e69242e7627091a8bd225de8b4.webm?t=1771724515\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431790/extras/22de57e69242e7627091a8bd225de8b4.mp4?t=1771724515\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25b6\ufe0fPetting your dog parries attacks and deflects projectiles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431790/extras/6395c810b10661444cf1f35ebd583fea.poster.avif?t=1771724515\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431790/extras/6395c810b10661444cf1f35ebd583fea.webm?t=1771724515\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431790/extras/6395c810b10661444cf1f35ebd583fea.mp4?t=1771724515\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25b6\ufe0fHit streaks activate Turbo and make your weapon super big and you super fast!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431790/extras/0ca0bd0fccce67848bf46356c09a84b4.poster.avif?t=1771724515\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431790/extras/0ca0bd0fccce67848bf46356c09a84b4.webm?t=1771724515\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431790/extras/0ca0bd0fccce67848bf46356c09a84b4.mp4?t=1771724515\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25b6\ufe0fCollect Mini\u2019s memories to uncover a past mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431790/extras/9d1198fc7e20d36b7702462ae7c7941c.poster.avif?t=1771724515\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431790/extras/9d1198fc7e20d36b7702462ae7c7941c.webm?t=1771724515\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431790/extras/9d1198fc7e20d36b7702462ae7c7941c.mp4?t=1771724515\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25b6\ufe0fDiscover the backstories of NPCs you meet in the present reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431790/extras/21a40e9c96c96e578b721a78fff31bfa.poster.avif?t=1771724515\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431790/extras/21a40e9c96c96e578b721a78fff31bfa.webm?t=1771724515\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431790/extras/21a40e9c96c96e578b721a78fff31bfa.mp4?t=1771724515\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25b6\ufe0fRevive Mini and craft her favourite items for her Cyber Paradise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431790/extras/22b79cbc671b42f902ab18212e9a375a.poster.avif?t=1771724515\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431790/extras/22b79cbc671b42f902ab18212e9a375a.webm?t=1771724515\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25b6\ufe0fChoose Cosy Mode for a story-focused playthrough and let the magic wand (and dogs) do the hard work!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Story Overview</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a not-so-distant future, reality's been exposed as a mere computer simulation. Every aspect of life, from our appearance and possessions, to our thoughts and experiences, is pre-determined by algorithms. When we die, we are deleted; our life data fragmented and discarded into The Lost Sector. There's no heaven or hell, just hard, cold digits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yet, amidst the despair of this discovery, you seize the opportunity and turn it into a business - you found Cyber Paradise - a service scavenging the digital remains of the dearly departed in The Lost Sector and reassembling them within a digital sanctuary. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You take on the role of Hayley, a skilled hacker-warrior, and team up with your dog DDmeow on this adventure. Vanquish monsters manifested by the deceased's fear and sorrow; uncover the mystery of your clients' pasts, and bond with the patrons within Mini's cafe that serves as your base. There, amid the hustle and bustle, catch a glimpse of this dystopian world through their shared stories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the first episode, witness a heartfelt narrative through Mini-the-dog's memories as you mend the hearts left behind in the wake of her passing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>","developers":["DDmeow Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431790/30763a1b3d61e2894aab74333f2415e48012f397/header_alt_assets_4.jpg?t=1771724515","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> MacBookAir7,2<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Apple M1 Chip (8-core CPU)<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</stro